{"id":"torrey:oak-tree-the","source":"torrey","name":"Oak Tree, The","slug":"oak-tree-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The hill of Bashan celebrated for — Isa 2:13.","refs":[["Isa",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Strong. — Am 2:9.","refs":[["Amos",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Thick spreading. — 2Sa 18:9; Eze 6:13.","refs":[["2Sam",18,9,18,9],["Ezek",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Casting its leaves in winter. — Isa 6:13.","refs":[["Isa",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"The people of Tyre made oars of — Eze 27:6.","refs":[["Ezek",27,6,27,6]]},{"text":"Idolaters often made idols of — Isa 44:14.","refs":[["Isa",44,14,44,14]]},{"text":"Rested under. — Jdj 6:11,19; 1Ki 13:14.","refs":[["Judg",6,11,6,11],["Judg",6,19,6,19],["1Kgs",13,14,13,14]]},{"text":"Buried their dead under. — Ge 35:8; 1Ch 10:12.","refs":[["Gen",35,8,35,8],["1Chr",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Erected monuments under. — Jos 24:26.","refs":[["Josh",24,26,24,26]]},{"text":"Performed idolatrous rites under. — Isa 1:29; 57:5; Eze 6:13; Ho 4:13.","refs":[["Isa",1,29,1,29],["Isa",57,5,57,5],["Ezek",6,13,6,13],["Hos",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"Absalom in his flight intercepted by, and suspended from — 2Sa 18:9,10,14.","refs":[["2Sam",18,9,18,9],["2Sam",18,10,18,10],["2Sam",18,14,18,14]]},{"text":"Jacob buried his family idols under — Ge 35:4.","refs":[["Gen",35,4,35,4]]},{"text":"Of the church. — Isa 6:13.","refs":[["Isa",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Of strong and powerful men. — Am 2:9.","refs":[["Amos",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Of wicked rulers. — Isa 2:13; Zec 11:2.","refs":[["Isa",2,13,2,13],["Zech",11,2,11,2]]},{"text":"(Fading,) of the wicked under judgments. — Isa 1:30.","refs":[["Isa",1,30,1,30]]}],"refCount":26}
